-- A company of Nords: mentor points at one's teacher and may dangle (-1); leader points at one's commander and is total. The hop rel.Comp asks a question about the entity at the far end of the link.
--! registry ../registries/008-relationship-hops.reg
--! expect gold = 1000 0 1000 1000 0 0
--! expect mentored = 0 0 0 0 0 1
--! expect morale = 100 100 80 100 80 100

Nord & mentor.TwoHanded > 80 , Gold += 1000
Student & mentor.Dead , -Mentored
Soldier & leader.AtWar , Morale -= 20
